"start":131631,"dur":4137},{"text":"seven raw coffee\nbeans back to his homeland from Yemen,","start":135768,"dur":5039},{"text":"laying the beginnings for Coffee's\nworldwide takeover. Arabica Coffee loved","start":140874,"dur":7540},{"text":"for its smooth and sweet flavor, now makes up\n60 to 70% of the global coffee market.","start":148414,"dur":9243},{"text":"The rest of the market\nis made up of Robusta, a stronger and more bitter tasting coffee","start":157757,"dur":7674},{"text":"made from one of Arabica parents. Coffee Canfora. To learn about Arabica coffee's past,","start":165532,"dur":8675},{"text":"researchers studied\nthe genetic information or genomes of C","start":174274,"dur":5972},{"text":"kind of foray and another apparent plant\ncalled coffee a uji A.S.. They also studied","start":180246,"dur":7041}],"analysisVersion":1,"punctuatedByAi":false,"createdAt":0,"updatedAt":0,"sample":{"level":"B1","topic":"学習者向けニュース（コーヒーの起源）","reason":"ゆっくり読まれるが、ニュースの長い文と科学の語彙（genes, researchers）が出る（約 108 語/分）","wpm":108,"license":"パブリックドメイン（VOA Learning English）","credit":"VOA Learning English（learningenglish.voanews.com）","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PKS3BxI_mvs"}}